{"video":"e7kfmMKnAlw","lines":[{"t":[0,3.5],"en":"What is it, hon?"},{"t":[4,6.3],"en":"Nothing. I can't find anything that I want to eat."},{"t":[6.4,7.8],"en":"Everything makes me nauseous."},{"t":[8.1,9.9],"en":"I'm telling you, being pregnant is no piece of cake."},{"t":[10.4,10.9],"en":"Ooh, cake."},{"t":[12.6,13],"en":"No."},{"t":[14.7,15.9],"en":"Oh, honey, I'm sorry."},{"t":[16.2,16.7],"en":"God."},{"t":[17.5,19],"en":"Ooh, what is that smell?"},{"t":[19.8,21],"en":"It's coming from the bathroom."},{"t":[22.2,24.6],"en":"Well, pregnancy does give you some weird cravings."},{"t":[26.1,26.5],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[26.6,27.4],"en":"It's me, it's Phoebe."},{"t":[27.9,29.7],"en":"Listen, there's something in here I want to eat."},{"t":[29.7,30.3],"en":"What, what?"},{"t":[32.2,33.5],"en":"What smells so good?"},{"t":[35,36],"en":"Is it the shampoo?"},{"t":[36.3,36.9],"en":"It's guava."},{"t":[37.8,38.2],"en":"No."},{"t":[39.4,40.3],"en":"Oh, wait, wait."},{"t":[42,43.2],"en":"Is it my bologna sandwich?"},{"t":[46.6,48.1],"en":"Yes, yes, yes."},{"t":[48.6,50.3],"en":"I can't believe it. The baby wants bologna."},{"t":[50.5,52.6],"en":"The baby wants me to eat meat. I can't eat meat."},{"t":[52.9,53.6],"en":"Wait, wait."},{"t":[55.5,56.3],"en":"Maybe it's a pickle."},{"t":[59.3,66.5],"en":"I can't believe it."},{"t":[66.5,67],"en":"I can't believe it."}]}
